      "kind": "concrete fixture contract hole, observed phase not proven",
      "code": "SettleOriginal::recv delegates Offers::recv; Offers drains UDP wake and returns Ok(false) when empty, ignoring Stalled.closed. Shared::end sends shutdown wake before mailbox close. An unbounded reader can consume the only wake/re-poll before the closing mail is observed; unlike a real stream EOF this readiness is not persistent."
    },
